ed_at":"2026-09-30T16:57:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123990","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123990","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123990.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123990.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-30T16:57:13Z"},"body":"On browsers that don't support MSAA via the `OCULUS_multiview` extension (including desktop Chrome with the WebXR emulator plugin), it currently outputs:\r\n\r\n```\r\nWARNING: Multiview MSAA is not supported on this device.\r\n```\r\n\r\n... followed by this error spammed every single frame:\r\n\r\n```\r\nTrying to call glFramebufferTextureMultisampleMultiviewOVR() without the OCULUS_multiview extension\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis fixes the issue by fully clearing the MSAA settings in `_clear_msaa3d_buffers()` which is called before determining if MSAA is supported or not.\r\n\r\nWith this PR, I only get the first warning and no spam!","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":